From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Fri, 2 Jan 2026 18:21:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Comprehensive thread-safety fixes for all
 getBlockState/getFluidState/getChunk calls

- Fixed Entity.java: move(), isInWall(), updateSwimming(), updateFluidOnEyes(), updateFluidHeightAndDoFluidPushing()
- Fixed LivingEntity.java: travel() fluid check
- Fixed Player.java: travel(), freeAt(), playStepSound()
- Fixed ServerPlayer.java: findRespawnAndUseSpawnBlock(), startSleepInBed(), doCheckFallDamage()
- Fixed ServerGamePacketListenerImpl.java: noBlocksAround(), handleSetCommandBlock(), handleSetStructureBlock(), handleSetJigsawBlock(), sign spawn protection check
- Fixed PlayerList.java: respawn anchor/bed check

All changes use isTickThread() instead of complex isTickThreadFor() checks.
Server thread is NOT a TickThread, so isTickThread() properly identifies when
we need to use non-blocking *IfLoaded variants.

